    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Sandbox Game: Free Exploration, Infinite Possibilities\u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.\u200b\u200bFreely converse with AI-powered characters\u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.\u200b\u200bCharacters will respond in real-time based on your words, changing expressions, etc.\u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Freely create and import character assets, edit stats, personalities, movement logic, and more\u200b</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Sandbox Game: Free Exploration, Infinite Possibilities\u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.\u200b\u200bFreely converse with AI-powered characters\u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.\u200b\u200bCharacters will respond in real-time based on your words, changing expressions, etc.\u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Freely create and import character assets, edit stats, personalities, movement logic, and more\u200b</p>",
    "short_description": "\u200b\u200b&quot;2D Hearts: AI Sandbox Adventure&quot;\u200b\u200b is an AI sandbox visual novel. Type to chat with NPCs\u2014AI generates real-time responses with dynamic expressions. Explore freely, design characters via AI, and edit their behaviors. Its memory system handles massive text, creating an endlessly expandable world.",
